%utlx 1.0
// Given a GitHub "list tags" response, emit each tag name on its own line.
//
// NOTE: `input.*.name` does NOT work when the document root is an array —
// it raises "Cannot access property on non-object UDM type". map() over the
// root is the working idiom.
input json
output csv
---
map(input, (t) -> t.name)
